art_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 2, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "Reporting period: FY2025", "text_sha256": "7c5457171a00fb8177446d0357b7e4fdb1f6f46be7777f65b851e9db3b7c6c23", "quote": "Reporting period: FY2025", "start": 0, "end": 24, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_mf_doc_sales_ceca243b8debb2a3a128", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_mf", "document_id": "mf_doc_sales", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 3, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "SYNTHETIC DATA. FY2025 management sales schedules reconcile to recognized revenue. Customer identities are invented; customer labels do not demonstrate credit quality or future order commitments.", "text_sha256": "6eaa34f1e61414bfce3489b1365cc739ef760d78288dd19a96d5c98bc46d01e5", "quote": "SYNTHETIC DATA. FY2025 management sales schedules reconcile to recognized revenue. Customer identities are invented; customer labels do not demonstrate credit quality or future order commitments.", "start": 0, "end": 195, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_mf_doc_sales_b4db6dd93727609f53c9", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_mf", "document_id": "mf_doc_sales", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 4, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "FY2025 recognized revenue is Brindle Retail USD 4,500,000, Fern Wholesale USD 2,000,000, Hearth Distribution USD 1,500,000 and direct-to-consumer sales USD 2,000,000. Brindle represents 45% of total revenue.", "text_sha256": "5463155fcaea67024d98ab06809a1422ad6b954a1a877ea5cd3e156adabf2d00", "quote": "FY2025 recognized revenue is Brindle Retail USD 4,500,000, Fern Wholesale USD 2,000,000, Hearth Distribution USD 1,500,000 and direct-to-consumer sales USD 2,000,000. Brindle represents 45% of total revenue.", "start": 0, "end": 207, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_mf_doc_sales_342a801edcd04c2f9f9f", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_mf", "document_id": "mf_doc_sales", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 5, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "FY2025 recognized revenue comprises 60,000 storage-unit equivalents at USD 100 and 20,000 cookware-unit equivalents at USD 200: USD 6,000,000 plus USD 4,000,000 equals USD 10,000,000.", "text_sha256": "df460866c4088f9c7272daceefd7c80d875ed21be093682d33b53d1cc7c80523", "quote": "FY2025 recognized revenue comprises 60,000 storage-unit equivalents at USD 100 and 20,000 cookware-unit equivalents at USD 200: USD 6,000,000 plus USD 4,000,000 equals USD 10,000,000.", "start": 0, "end": 183, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_mf_doc_sales_8aacde274d9c4265e37e", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_mf", "document_id": "mf_doc_sales", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 6, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "Domestic revenue is USD 8,000,000 and export revenue USD 2,000,000. The export channel grew, but domestic business still comprises 80% of recognized revenue.", "text_sha256": "dd7dea65d153de9cd3cb7e172dd7dbd8d70fcf5c648ae4c89b57cf1315162a84", "quote": "Domestic revenue is USD 8,000,000 and export revenue USD 2,000,000. The export channel grew, but domestic business still comprises 80% of recognized revenue.", "start": 0, "end": 157, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_mf_doc_sales_bb70420220707e9ad874", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_mf", "document_id": "mf_doc_sales", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 7, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "Brindle annual purchase forecasts are nonbinding. No minimum-volume commitment or signed FY2027 order book is supplied. Management calls the customer base diversified despite the 45% single-customer exposure.", "text_sha256": "ae017b98a0680af7732de2866abdb93d711041cd4adb29d9c5d8d1a469f2bf56", "quote": "Brindle annual purchase forecasts are nonbinding. No minimum-volume commitment or signed FY2027 order book is supplied. Management calls the customer base diversified despite the 45% single-customer exposure.", "start": 0, "end": 208, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_mf_doc_sales_dedebb4e0a408aa1a3b1", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_mf", "document_id": "mf_doc_sales", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 8, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "No product category accounts for all sales, and 20% of revenue comes from direct-to-consumer sales. These are documented mix characteristics, not independent proof of customer retention.", "text_sha256": "b7e2080c3750e77bd3e26cf818d770654956cfcadbdf2fedad0bc89ea276b364", "quote": "No product category accounts for all sales, and 20% of revenue comes from direct-to-consumer sales. These are documented mix characteristics, not independent proof of customer retention.", "start": 0, "end": 186, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_mf_doc_sales_69b2136e0fdbb7c9ba00", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_mf", "document_id": "mf_doc_sales", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_table_cell", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "table_index": 0, "row": 0, "column": 0, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "Customer", "text_sha256": "bf3763383aaf43069885db20b386631c6d5d8b8481df2a26769e9de5fe2f9c82", "quote": "Customer", "start": 0, "end": 8, "locator_status": "v