lock_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "Ridgeway Manufacturing Capacity and CAPEX Schedule", "text_sha256": "2245a045dcb56cb4b08f767332583bcc0269096a0c6aa027022cc98521a2b978", "quote": "Ridgeway Manufacturing Capacity and CAPEX Schedule", "start": 0, "end": 50, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_mf_doc_plant_31e9674a80c1e8e12c05", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_mf", "document_id": "mf_doc_plant", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 1, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "SYNTHETIC | mf_doc_plant | 2026-11-03 | Version 1", "text_sha256": "578a90fb76c5876784b2d8280e8f8a065879a1a9bc4cd12e20bb5503ce9418ca", "quote": "SYNTHETIC | mf_doc_plant | 2026-11-03 | Version 1", "start": 0, "end": 49, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_mf_doc_plant_130822f9f8e075713074", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_mf", "document_id": "mf_doc_plant", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 2, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "Reporting period: FY2025 actual and FY2027 capacity", "text_sha256": "8de33bb29efb69b9e62f5faba3e94b23b03b9d058a82296a1a592ee3d173af8f", "quote": "Reporting period: FY2025 actual and FY2027 capacity", "start": 0, "end": 51, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_mf_doc_plant_56c9f421020708e58c01", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_mf", "document_id": "mf_doc_plant", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 3, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "SYNTHETIC DATA. Management plant schedule. Standardized production-slot equivalents are used for planning and are distinct from the product-unit quantities in the sales schedule.", "text_sha256": "5e3f56a1600197c68c39476bee39bdddcd9d4aae34df621489716e8cb808ad1f", "quote": "SYNTHETIC DATA. Management plant schedule. Standardized production-slot equivalents are used for planning and are distinct from the product-unit quantities in the sales schedule.", "start": 0, "end": 178, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_mf_doc_plant_780b3c065193893d9753", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_mf", "document_id": "mf_doc_plant", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 4, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "Current practical capacity is 100,000 standardized production-slot equivalents per year. The FY2027 plan requires 120,000 equivalents. An additional 20,000-slot press has neither an executed purchase order nor committed financing in the supplied pack.", "text_sha256": "12522b7e8ba7b5e5eccae89d0cd13de1efb4a82750cadb061295c50b7d7ab67e", "quote": "Current practical capacity is 100,000 standardized production-slot equivalents per year. The FY2027 plan requires 120,000 equivalents. An additional 20,000-slot press has neither an executed purchase order nor committed financing in the supplied pack.", "start": 0, "end": 251, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_mf_doc_plant_a0687f01dfa808e80c20", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_mf", "document_id": "mf_doc_plant", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 5, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "FY2025 CAPEX USD 1,000,000 consists of USD 600,000 replacement and safety work required to sustain existing operations and USD 400,000 expansion projects. Management initially describes the entire USD 1,000,000 as discretionary growth investment.", "text_sha256": "f22bd14dd74a2ae991b4efa0497d9b010b583ca74a6f70fa402a58d26c2ff16c", "quote": "FY2025 CAPEX USD 1,000,000 consists of USD 600,000 replacement and safety work required to sustain existing operations and USD 400,000 expansion projects. Management initially describes the entire USD 1,000,000 as discretionary growth investment.", "start": 0, "end": 246, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_mf_doc_plant_c39c59baa775a81f31ec", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_mf", "document_id": "mf_doc_plant", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 6, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "Management engineering logs classify the USD 600,000 replacement and safety amount as maintenance CAPEX. Supplier invoices, asset-condition reports and the recurring maintenance budget have not been independently checked.", "text_sha256": "f70acc59f362ebbab75b9217ef8f40b11409b2b58781b77a8583a5f8e2cf6062", "quote": "Management engineering logs classify the USD 600,000 replacement and safety amount as maintenance CAPEX. Supplier invoices, asset-condition reports and the recurring maintenance budget have not been independently checked.", "start": 0, "end": 221, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_mf_doc_plant_48eaace17366acbfcced", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_mf", "document_id": "mf_doc_plant", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 7, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "Opening net PPE USD 2,000,000 plus FY2025 additions USD 1,000,000 less depreciation USD 400,000 equals closing net PPE USD 2,600,000. There are no disposals, impairments or revaluations in the supplied roll-forward.", "text_sha256": "4769e9b2d5168829aae0889f9ece1a81eb90901ebd2f30df6100442f897063bc", "quote": "Opening net PPE USD 2,000,000 plus FY2025 additions USD 1,000,000 less depreciation USD 400,000 equals closing net PPE USD 2,600,000. There are no disposals, impairments or revaluations in the supplied roll-forward.", "start": 0, "end": 215, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_mf_doc_plant_9ad86c2c0b9e7027fda1", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_mf", "document_id": "mf_doc_plant", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 8, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "Existing plant supports current sales volume without the proposed new press. The additional equipment is a growth dependency, not a condition for maintaining all current operations.", "text_sha256": "ad4efc2909a365d06e3a6d72577a7cef013f2c72cb1c5528d2e08736d6f403a3", "quote": "Existing plant supports current sales volume without the proposed new press. The additional equipment is a growth dependency, not a condition for maintaining all current operations.", "start": 0, "end": 181, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_mf_doc_plant_a24152656dc58f2608f7", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_mf", "document_id": "mf_doc_plant", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_table_cell", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "table_index": 0, "row": 0, "column": 0, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "FY2025 category", "text_sha256": "30e9d93562bbdcd9fde7ebe246b9e75838707070f9183b5f6bf34229fd2b13ed", "quote": "FY2025 category", "start": 0, "end": 15, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_mf_doc_plant_422b06a7d6bd3059d3f7", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_mf", "document_id": "mf_doc_plant", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_table_cell", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "table_index": 0, "row": 0, "column": 1, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "USD", "text_sha256": "a26cdf3a6e709124385d4d7eb9bff6b897a58ed5597fbab779b89849dbe81b21", "quote": "USD", "start": 0, "end": 3, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_mf_doc_plant_d631fd9c9243867c4c0b", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_mf", "document_id": "mf_doc_plant", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_table_cell", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "table_index": 0, "row": 1, "column": 0, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "Maintenance and safety", "text_sha256": "fff50ccde2068c511840f5e15557186064ca2b08992d02430a6142d3e0e0769b", "quote": "Maintenance and safety", "start": 0, "end": 22, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_mf_doc_plant_96a6eef68aee6e1e5fa8", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_mf", "document_id": "mf_doc_plant", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_table_cell", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "table_index": 0, "row": 1, "column": 1, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "600000", "text_sha256": "a3c25177bb8fb18ab261743d2296eb0edb79ee7234493f24f20b8f85b5b9a9d8", "quote": "600000", "start": 0, "end": 6, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_mf_doc_plant_c420e534669a2ef3e574", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_mf", "document_id": "mf_doc_plant", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_table_cell", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "table_index": 0, "row": 2, "column": 0, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "Expansion", "text_sha256": "0447fe78ffb9f4b1849820d3141058b28e402dfee6350955741c132e2d0f8b40", "quote": "Expansion", "start": 0, "end": 9, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_mf_doc_plant_5ffa99f5ac59bcc66e3b", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_mf", "document_id": "mf_doc_plant", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_table_cell", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "table_index": 0, "row": 2, "column": 1, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "400000", "text_sha256": "ad1e2e29fe1631ddf7bedaadffe63c4efd61e6909a1ed0648e7b9645bd27dab5", "quote": "400000", "start": 0, "end": 6, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_mf_doc_plant_7249f60b772150e52933", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_mf", "document_id": "mf_doc_plant", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_table_cell", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "table_index": 0, "row": 3, "column": 0, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "Total", "text_sha256": "c9b3c38247f744e17dd26fda097d6a9ba9332586b6bdaa038bf8f313a863f2b8", "quote": "Total", "start": 0, "end": 5, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_mf_doc_plant_8a703674ca5cbd25fd7e", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_mf", "document_id": "mf_doc_plant", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_table_cell", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "table_index": 0, "row": 3, "column": 1, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "1000000", "text_sha256": "6cce36d9f8a9e151b100234af75cca89d55bcb94c153f51847debdf1f39cae45", "quote": "1000000", "start": 0, "end": 7, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_mf_doc_forecast_b2329477e00f83ee3cb3", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_mf", "document_id": "mf_doc_forecast", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "Ridgeway FY2027 Management Plan and Initial Q&A", "text_sha256": "0a6b0f1d2682799ee36cdddcc219bec6e5cdb0d6df7555379e7eb3144542c557", "quote": "Ridgeway FY2027 Management Plan and Initial Q&A", "start": 0, "end": 47, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_mf_doc_forecast_a71b3805096d5994d9d4", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_mf", "document_id": "mf_doc_forecast", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 1, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "SYNTHETIC | mf_doc_forecast | 2026-11-03 | Version 1", "text_sha256": "a1a597e1f773e88b1c10ba4e72bd29b6c9fdd1478540416637234fa8b5c07c6b", "quote": "SYNTHETIC | mf_doc_forecast | 2026-11-03 | Version 1", "start": 0, "end": 52, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_mf_doc_forecast_aab0a14c7d3cd17d18ed", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_mf", "document_id": "mf_doc_forecast", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 2, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "Reporting period: FY2027", "text_sha256": "b941b1a4c022ea6e8a25e1f1dc5f9cad337b1d1c8c17d10575a383f9a79d1614", "quote": "Reporting period: FY2027", "start": 0, "end": 24, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_mf_doc_forecast_e5f712f844324642f093", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_mf", "document_id": "mf_doc_forecast", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 3, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "SYNTHETIC DATA. Management plan version 1, dated 2026-11-03. Forecasts are assumptions and have no independent assurance. No unprovided FY2026 actual result is assumed.", "text_sha256": "75ae512513f943ed13671511c65c882a4205995fed283e1e3890441ba75fb551", "quote": "SYNTHETIC DATA. Management plan version 1, dated 2026-11-03. Forecasts are assumptions and have no independent assurance. No unprovided FY2026 actual result is assumed.", "start": 0, "end": 168, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_mf_doc_forecast_b8b908136ba97ae31d92", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_mf", "document_id": "mf_doc_forecast", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 4, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "FY2027 revenue is forecast as 120,000 standardized production-slot equivalents at a blended USD 100 revenue per equivalent, totaling USD 12,000,000. Cost of sales USD 7,560,000 and operating expense excluding depreciation USD 2,740,000 produce forecast EBITDA USD 1,700,000.", "text_sha256": "13f630dbe4fc8152497d939d4c317755f353a680b7fd013e60de5f67cca163b6", "quote": "FY2027 revenue is forecast as 120,000 standardized production-slot equivalents at a blended USD 100 revenue per equivalent, totaling USD 12,000,000. Cost of sales USD 7,560,000 and operating expense excluding depreciation USD 2,740,000 produce forecast EBITDA USD 1,700,000.", "start": 0, "end": 274, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_mf_doc_forecast_191a515cea89c504585a", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_mf", "document_id": "mf_doc_forecast", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 5, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "The plan assumes the additional press will be available for the whole year. With current practical capacity of 100,000 equivalents and the same blended revenue rate, supported capacity would produce USD 10,000,000. No funded installation schedule supports the additional capacity.", "text_sha256": "a7de3812a424f1d24f961355a7121e7d03af611609a9e5420cfe3d342c87afd1", "quote": "The plan assumes the additional press will be available for the whole year. With current practical capacity of 100,000 equivalents and the same blended revenue rate, supported capacity would produce USD 10,000,000. No funded installation schedule supports the additional capacity.", "start": 0, "end": 280, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_mf_doc_forecast_06cc025652266517e8ba", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_mf", "document_id": "mf_doc_forecast", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 6, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "The FY2027 plan reduces closing inventory to USD 1,200,000 while cost of sales rises to USD 7,560,000. The target implies 57.9365 closing-inventory days, compared with 136.875 days in FY2025. No signed inventory clearance program or documented lead-time improvement supports the reduction.", "text_sha256": "d51359a08fbe9c28fd839d076b81e01e739ac7d415947fe0192b386245162c26", "quote": "The FY2027 plan reduces closing inventory to USD 1,200,000 while cost of sales rises to USD 7,560,000. The target implies 57.9365 closing-inventory days, compared with 136.875 days in FY2025. No signed inventory clearance program or documented lead-time improvement supports the reduction.", "start": 0, "end": 289, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_mf_doc_forecast_a4cca3fc86d289434ceb", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_mf", "document_id": "mf_doc_forecast", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 7, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "Planned operating NWC is USD 1,500,000: receivables USD 1,800,000 plus inventory USD 1,200,000 plus prepaids USD 100,000 less trade payables USD 1,200,000 and accrued operating costs USD 400,000. Relative to FY2025, the plan assumes USD 1,100,000 cash release from working capital.", "text_sha256": "cb866f08fe5a9b8293f38c5c709dc0dab1baed6295932c3e5864312c0892d881", "quote": "Planned operating NWC is USD 1,500,000: receivables USD 1,800,000 plus inventory USD 1,200,000 plus prepaids USD 100,000 less trade payables USD 1,200,000 and accrued operating costs USD 400,000. Relative to FY2025, the plan assumes USD 1,100,000 cash release from working capital.", "start": 0, "end": 281, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_mf_doc_forecast_9bceeb5578b190b2f75b", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_mf", "document_id": "mf_doc_forecast", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 8, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "Management repeats that EBITDA growth proves cash generation, that all CAPEX is expansion and that inventory will halve. These answers repeat the management financial and plant schedules; they are not independent confirmations.", "text_sha256": "3a276a3d2213bc343c2f3f409fa5afa0fdd726c5753afefcffaa18b3d1070adb", "quote": "Management repeats that EBITDA growth proves cash generation, that all CAPEX is expansion and that inventory will halve. These answers repeat the management financial and plant schedules; they are not independent confirmations.", "start": 0, "end": 227, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_mf_doc_forecast_21a5b594747c2cfdde2e", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_mf", "document_id": "mf_doc_forecast", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_table_cell", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "table_index": 0, "row": 0, "column": 0, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "FY2027 driver", "text_sha256": "ae2e299ca27eadef9a24759495e6ed9d9b05b66cf5df9e44db18adc19062998e", "quote": "FY2027 driver", "start": 0, "end": 13, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_mf_doc_forecast_dd2fd8d5fc4e1787f71d", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_mf", "document_id": "mf_doc_forecast", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_table_cell", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "table_index": 0, "row": 0, "column": 1, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "Value", "text_sha256": "8e37953d23daca5ff01b8282c33f4e0a2152f1d1885f94c06418617e3ee1d24e", "quote": "Value", "start": 0, "end": 5, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_mf_doc_forecast_c2afa