o USD 1,200,000 while cost of sales rises to USD 7,560,000. The target implies 57.9365 closing-inventory days, compared with 136.875 days in FY2025. No signed inventory clearance program or documented lead-time improvement supports the reduction.", "text_sha256": "d51359a08fbe9c28fd839d076b81e01e739ac7d415947fe0192b386245162c26", "quote": "The FY2027 plan reduces closing inventory to USD 1,200,000 while cost of sales rises to USD 7,560,000. The target implies 57.9365 closing-inventory days, compared with 136.875 days in FY2025. No signed inventory clearance program or documented lead-time improvement supports the reduction.", "start": 0, "end": 289, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_mf_doc_forecast_18a5c39d3f291e90168a", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_mf", "document_id": "mf_doc_forecast", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_table_cell", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "table_index": 0, "row": 5, "column": 0, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "Cost of sales USD", "text_sha256": "11c79d77e7a4dd55168cf4dff102203d921499ac948e53beaad925382dcb336d", "quote": "Cost of sales USD", "start": 0, "end": 17, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_mf_doc_forecast_191a515cea89c504585a", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_mf", "document_id": "mf_doc_forecast", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 5, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "The plan assumes the additional press will be available for the whole year. With current practical capacity of 100,000 equivalents and the same blended revenue rate, supported capacity would produce USD 10,000,000. No funded installation schedule supports the additional capacity.", "text_sha256": "a7de3812a424f1d24f961355a7121e7d03af611609a9e5420cfe3d342c87afd1", "quote": "The plan assumes the additional press will be available for the whole year. With current practical capacity of 100,000 equivalents and the same blended revenue rate, supported capacity would produce USD 10,000,000. No funded installation schedule supports the additional capacity.", "start": 0, "end": 280, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_mf_doc_forecast_21a5b594747c2cfdde2e", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_mf", "document_id": "mf_doc_forecast", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_table_cell", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "table_index": 0, "row": 0, "column": 0, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "FY2027 driver", "text_sha256": "ae2e299ca27eadef9a24759495e6ed9d9b05b66cf5df9e44db18adc19062998e", "quote": "FY2027 driver", "start": 0, "end": 13, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_mf_doc_forecast_3ad062b284b79e9c8101", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_mf", "document_id": "mf_doc_forecast", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_table_cell", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "table_index": 0, "row": 3, "column": 0, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "Revenue per equivalent USD", "text_sha256": "9a2a80818df40ca5746e4acf8d00caa293df42157169d153bfba39d2672768e9", "quote": "Revenue per equivalent USD", "start": 0, "end": 26, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_mf_doc_forecast_4cd68256f93cbceeb265", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_mf", "document_id": "mf_doc_forecast", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_table_cell", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "table_index": 0, "row": 7, "column": 1, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "1700000", "text_sha256": "de6f36d7c7e470f726d1bd5ef2bcb61e63b3bc78c393441e8acd42aa9177fe0c", "quote": "1700000", "start": 0, "end": 7, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_mf_doc_forecast_4d5c9f102af8c41662f1", 