proves cash generation, that all CAPEX is expansion and that inventory will halve. These answers repeat the management financial and plant schedules; they are not independent confirmations.", "text_sha256": "3a276a3d2213bc343c2f3f409fa5afa0fdd726c5753afefcffaa18b3d1070adb", "quote": "Management repeats that EBITDA growth proves cash generation, that all CAPEX is expansion and that inventory will halve. These answers repeat the management financial and plant schedules; they are not independent confirmations.", "start": 0, "end": 227, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_mf_doc_forecast_a4cca3fc86d289434ceb", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_mf", "document_id": "mf_doc_forecast", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 7, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "Planned operating NWC is USD 1,500,000: receivables USD 1,800,000 plus inventory USD 1,200,000 plus prepaids USD 100,000 less trade payables USD 1,200,000 and accrued operating costs USD 400,000. Relative to FY2025, the plan assumes USD 1,100,000 cash release from working capital.", "text_sha256": "cb866f08fe5a9b8293f38c5c709dc0dab1baed6295932c3e5864312c0892d881", "quote": "Planned operating NWC is USD 1,500,000: receivables USD 1,800,000 plus inventory USD 1,200,000 plus prepaids USD 100,000 less trade payables USD 1,200,000 and accrued operating costs USD 400,000. Relative to FY2025, the plan assumes USD 1,100,000 cash release from working capital.", "start": 0, "end": 281, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_mf_doc_forecast_a71b3805096d5994d9d4", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_mf", "document_id": "mf_doc_forecast", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 1, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "SYNTHETIC | mf_doc_forecast | 2026-11-03 | Version 1", "text_sha256": "a1a597e1f773e88b1c10ba4e72bd29b6c9fdd1478540416637234fa8b5c07c6b", "quote": "SYNTHETIC | mf_doc_forecast | 2026-11-03 | Version 1", "start": 0, "end": 52, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_mf_doc_forecast_aab0a14c7d3cd17d18ed", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_mf", "document_id": "mf_doc_forecast", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 2, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "Reporting period: FY2027", "text_sha256": "b941b1a4c022ea6e8a25e1f1dc5f9cad337b1d1c8c17d10575a383f9a79d1614", "quote": "Reporting period: FY2027", "start": 0, "end": 24, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_mf_doc_forecast_b1811ea3eecd062a8113", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_mf", "document_id": "mf_doc_forecast", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_table_cell", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "table_index": 0, "row": 6, "column": 0, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "Operating expense USD", "text_sha256": "6b4341515747c33065011f18853dff833cf3da2d5042c6189a3097511b0d575a", "quote": "Operating expense USD", "start": 0, "end": 21, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_mf_doc_forecast_b2329477e00f83ee3cb3", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_mf", "document_id": "mf_doc_forecast", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "Ridgeway FY2027 Management Plan and Initial Q&A", "text_sha256": "0a6b0f1d2682799ee36cdddcc219bec6e5cdb0d6df7555379e7eb3144542c557", "quote": "Ridgeway FY2027 Management Plan and Initial Q&A", "start": 0, "end": 47, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_mf_doc_forecast_b8b908136ba97ae31d92", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_mf", "document_id": "mf_doc_forecast", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_paragraph", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "block_index": 4, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "FY2027 revenue is forecast as 120,000 standardized production-slot equivalents at a blended USD 100 revenue per equivalent, totaling USD 12,000,000. Cost of sales USD 7,560,000 and operating expense excluding depreciation USD 2,740,000 produce forecast EBITDA USD 1,700,000.", "text_sha256": "13f630dbe4fc8152497d939d4c317755f353a680b7fd013e60de5f67cca163b6", "quote": "FY2027 revenue is forecast as 120,000 standardized production-slot equivalents at a blended USD 100 revenue per equivalent, totaling USD 12,000,000. Cost of sales USD 7,560,000 and operating expense excluding depreciation USD 2,740,000 produce forecast EBITDA USD 1,700,000.", "start": 0, "end": 274, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_mf_doc_forecast_c2afa260b868c12f2ac5", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_mf", "document_id": "mf_doc_forecast", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_table_cell", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "table_index": 0, "row": 1, "column": 0, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "Planned production equivalents", "text_sha256": "f1744e8449b145f39ea44b5d1a51e13ad4d2248d4e27cfc56ea321c09cc35547", "quote": "Planned production equivalents", "start": 0, "end": 30, "locator_status": "validated", "extraction_method": "parsed"}, {"id": "span_mf_doc_forecast_c89b458847a17996f36c", "entity_version": 1, "deal_id": "deal_mf", "document_id": "mf_doc_forecast", "document_version": 1, "locator": {"kind": "docx_table_cell", "part_uri": "word/document.xml", "table_index": 0, "row": 9, "column": 1, "paragraph_index": 0, "heading_path": []}, "normalized_text": "1500000", "text_sha256": "490d7c887c8033c20d2788eb073ad763d46ea740497158ab9b0fb2aa313b2f98", "quote": "1500000", "start": 0, "end": 7, "loc